acing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">42,374 in <a href=\"/wiki/1373_DR\" title=\"1373 DR\">1373 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><table class=\"percentagetable\"><tbody><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>  </td><td> 74%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Crinti\" title=\"Crinti\">Crinti</a>  </td><td> 15%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a>  </td><td> 5%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Halfling\" title=\"Halfling\">Halfling</a>  </td><td> 3%  </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">Gnoll</a>  </td><td> 2% </td></tr><tr><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" title=\"Half-orc\">Half-orc</a> </td><td> 1% </td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Loviatar\" title=\"Loviatar\">Loviatar</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eilistraee\" title=\"Eilistraee\">Eilistraee</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alignment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alignments</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lawful_evil\" title=\"Lawful evil\">Lawful evil</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Queen</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Queen</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hasafir\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hasafir\">Hasafir</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Cathyr\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Cathyr\">Inhabitants of  Cathyr</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Cathyr\" title=\"Category:Locations in Cathyr\">Locations in  Cathyr</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Cathyr (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9DYXRoeXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Organizations in  Cathyr</span></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Items from Cathyr (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6SXRlbXNfZnJvbV9DYXRoeXI/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Items from  Cathyr</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Cathyr</b> (also seen as <b>Cathtyr</b>) was a metropolis and the capital city of <a href=\"/wiki/Dambrath\" title=\"Dambrath\">Dambrath</a>. It was formerly known as <a href=\"/wiki/Shantil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shantil\">Shantil</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Cathyr sat in a small bay on the far eastern end of Dambrath. It marked the final southern stop of the <a href=\"/wiki/Trader%27s_Way\" title=\"Trader's Way\">Trader's Way</a>. The inner city was crowded and bustling. At the center of the city sat the queen's palace which was surrounded by broad green parks. The wealthy lived in two or three story town houses on the west side, while most of the poor huddled together in the eastern sections of the city closer to the docks. Some lived outside the city walls in hovels that reached southward along the coast.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Defenses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defenses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Temples\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Temples</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defenses\">Defenses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defenses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cathyr?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defenses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cathyr had a garrison of 2,000 troops to keep order and defend the city from invaders and monsters. Cathyr also had a fleet of 12 warships, half closely defended the port while the other half patrolled the waters near the city out to sea.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Temples\">Temples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Temples\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cathyr?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Temples\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Temple of Loviatar</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Temple_of_Lolth_(Cathyr)\" title=\"Temple of Lolth (Cathyr)\">Temple of Lolth</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cathyr?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hasafir\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hasafir\">Hasafir</a>, Queen of Dambrath and ruler of the city.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Rimala Grevos (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmltYWxhX0dyZXZvcz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Rimala Grevos</span>, leader of the city's garrison.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SS-p106_2-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cathyr?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cathyr?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notes\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<small><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-Spelling-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Spelling_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Older sourcebooks spell this \"Cathtyr\", but it was changed in later editions.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></small>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cathyr?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS-p106-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-6\">1.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p106_2-7\">1.7</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Reid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thomas Reid\">Thomas Reid</a>&#160;(October 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shining_South_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Shining South (sourcebook)\">Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 106. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\">0-7869-3492-1</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021091936\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.10